   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia Monitoring, Evaluating, and Learning Short-term Activity (MELSA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El prop&#xf3;sito de la actividad es brindar a la misi&#xf3;n servicios t&#xe9;cnicos y de asesor&#xed;a relacionados con el seguimiento, evaluaci&#xf3;n y aprendizaje de la estrategia y actividades de la misi&#xf3;n</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the activity is to provide the mission with technical and advisory services related to the monitoring, evaluation, and learning of the mission&apos;s strategy and activities</narrative>
  </description>
